---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="Who am I?">
    <section class="mb-20">
        <h1 class="section-title text-4xl mb-2">About</h1>
        <p class="led-accent text-sm mb-12">// a bit more about who I am</p>

        <div class="max-w-3xl">
            <div class="card mb-8">
                <p class="t-muted leading-relaxed mb-6">
                    My name is Bruno Fonseca and I'm a guy with a passion for
                    technology.<br/><br/>
                    I'm most experienced in Firmware and Embedded Software development.
                    <br/>
                    I have a background in Electrical Engineering and I love to build
                    things and watch them come to life.<br/>
                    <br/>
                    I also like to experiment with 3D printing, 3D design, hardware
                    and home automation.<br/>
                    In my free time I like to cook, explore nature and do some amateur photography now and then. <br/>
                    I love martial arts, video games and understanding how stuff works. <br/>
                    <br/>
                    Like any good engineer worth their salt, I love me a good coffe cup! <br/>
                    Just kidding, you don't have to drink coffe. Tea is also allowed 😉
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</BaseLayout>
